Looking at this problem, I need to evaluate $\lim_{n\to\infty}\frac{x_n - n}{\ln n}$ where $x_{n+1} = \sum_{k=1}^{n} x_k^{1/n}$ for $n \geq 2$ (with $x_1, x_2 > 0$ given).

